### What the page covers

| Section | Content |
|--------|---------|
| **Purpose** | Scans `.dashboard-kpi-card` and `[data-studio-tile]`; tiles that look clickable must be proper controls per `det-app-tile-affordance.check.js` |
| **Passing signals** | `<a href>` navigation tiles, `<button>` / `role="button"` + `tabindex`, static tiles without link styling |
| **Failing signals** | `<div>` with `dashboard-kpi-card--link` / pointer cursor; `tabindex` without role; major severity |
| **Before** | Failing `<div class="dashboard-kpi-card … dashboard-kpi-card--link">` with `data-studio-tile`, `dashboard-kpi-card__*`, `dashboard-status-pill` |
| **After** | Passing `<a class="dashboard-kpi-card … dashboard-kpi-card--link" href="…">` plus alt `<button … tile--link>` pattern |
| **Evidence** | `metrics.tileAffordanceReport`, harness commands, check module path |
| **Related rules** | `DET.APP.CONTROL_A11Y`, `DET.APP.PRIMARY_CTA`, `DET.NAV.FOCUS_ORDER`, `DET.APP.FOCUS_TRAP`, `AI.JS.BEHAVIOR_DISCOVERABILITY` |

### Real KS / check-aligned class names

Examples use classes the check actually targets (not the old stub’s `dashboard-tile card`):

- `.dashboard-kpi-card`, `.dashboard-kpi-card--link`, `.dashboard-kpi-card--interactive`, `.dashboard-kpi-card--risk`
- `.dashboard-kpi-card__label`, `__value`, `__status`
- `.dashboard-status-pill`, `.dashboard-kpi-row`, `.dashboard-kpi-row__grid`
- `[data-studio-tile]`, `data-studio-workspace`, `doc-main`
- `.tile--link` (secondary passing example for in-place actions)

Patterns align with governed dashboard metric cards (e.g. `createDashboardMetricCard` in operator UIs) and with `collectTileAffordanceReport` selectors.

